      "end_codepoint": 134,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete",
      "source_id": "s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:source_review15-0",
      "kind": "source_review",
      "person_id": "bn8_cdi_hv9",
      "source_quote": "　　永明元年，詔徵歡爲太學博士，同郡顧黯爲散騎郎。黯字長孺，有隱操，與歡俱不就徵。",
      "reading": "顧黯字長孺，另有散騎郎徵而不就，與歡同年徵事。",
      "note": "顧黯字長孺，另有散騎郎徵而不就，與歡同年徵事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p015",
